Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.04,0:00:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.32,0:00:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.42,0:00:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.02,0:00:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that can't be beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.06,0:00:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.66,0:00:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past every\Nwall that's in our wake!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.08,0:00:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Go without hesitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.82,0:00:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to press on a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,To get to the answers we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to this new world believing that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.82,0:00:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,surely someday we just might find the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All the pieces of our dreams\Nhave now come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bonds won't waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.48,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With our dreaming hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on towards
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.64,0:00:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,a bright new future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.64,0:01:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.26,0:01:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on, never stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.46,0:01:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your head up. Way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.48,0:01:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.16,0:01:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If waves erupt up to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.08,0:01:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up. Our wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.50,0:01:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.84,0:01:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.06,0:01:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,For the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.56,0:01:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We drift on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.30,0:01:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Riding the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Towards another shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.54,0:01:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Day by day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There are many meetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.42,0:01:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Many goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.60,0:01:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Underneath the flag we fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.96,0:01:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.54,0:01:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The pain within, I'll keep\Nit in my heart forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.96,0:01:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And never take it lightly,\Nbut I won't surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This freedom, I will keep in mind.\NI'll keep holding on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.68,0:01:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up,\Nsing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.58,0:02:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up, raise up\Nthe flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.44,0:02:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up, we'll get past\Neveryone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.32,0:02:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on. Never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.80,0:02:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up, keep your\Nhead up when I'm high.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.42,0:02:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up. If waves are\Nrough, jump through the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.02,0:02:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up, our wishes\Nthey will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on towards our future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.98,0:02:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.16,0:02:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I've worn that thing with\Nsome kind of passive beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.26,0:03:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But when the hell has\NCaesar ever been interested?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.36,0:03:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,in human weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.72,0:03:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Get me in range!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.82,0:03:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming right up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.08,0:03:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, he'll\Nregret shooting at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.78,0:03:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wanted to fight, well here it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.74,0:03:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,General, and okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.10,0:03:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even put a dent in him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.86,0:03:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,General! Shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.20,0:03:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too little and too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.82,0:03:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.73,0:03:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.65,0:03:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thread through a shield?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.06,0:03:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about desperate!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.46,0:03:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.37,0:03:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I'm just gonna have\Nto break out the big guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.72,0:03:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.78,0:03:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you're standing\Nbetween us and Caesar,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.38,0:03:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that makes you our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.06,0:03:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Weapon Morphosis!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.02,0:04:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Esparagirl!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Good guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.34,0:04:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Round and round!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.72,0:04:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Round and round!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.42,0:04:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.94,0:04:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you saying about\Nno more getting sidetracked?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.08,0:04:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for a more direct approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.96,0:04:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me Missile Girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.46,0:04:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Target is inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.88,0:04:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.74,0:04:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Launching! Spin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.40,0:04:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Projecto Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.36,0:04:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar's coming with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.22,0:04:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Caesar?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.46,0:04:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you even talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.70,0:05:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.24,0:05:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The heart of the leader of\Nthe G5. What a wonderful
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.80,0:05:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,souvenir thanks with\Nthis the fight is over
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.00,0:05:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Smoker, your heart is still in my\Nhands, and I'm not going to hell alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.76,0:05:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you Straw Hats\Nstanding around and waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.48,0:05:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let Caesar escape, or the\Nentire plan will be for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.74,0:05:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you, get on now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure we will, when we have everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.68,0:05:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting for my whole crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.16,0:06:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like your life depends on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.34,0:06:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're trying the best we can, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.44,0:06:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta move faster than the gas!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.16,0:06:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.07,0:06:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The gate is starting to close!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.20,0:06:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Only 50 meters left,\Nthen you're home free!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.18,0:06:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.54,0:06:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever floats your boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.84,0:06:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The gate's gonna close!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.76,0:06:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a close call!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.86,0:06:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The crew's all here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.40,0:06:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you trying to make us worry?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.34,0:06:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.82,0:06:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It was all thanks to\Nyou, Usa! That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.70,0:06:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't see him carrying you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.02,0:06:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, guys, you heard him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.80,0:06:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No reason to wait around,\Nright? All aboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.38,0:06:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to get out of here! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.90,0:06:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Kin'emon? Is there anything\Nwe can do for him? That's Kin'emon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.32,0:06:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,we're just gonna have to figure something
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.80,0:07:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,out later no what do they do to you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.98,0:07:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Joker, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.74,0:07:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.64,0:07:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Monet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.38,0:07:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Monet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.70,0:07:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.00,0:07:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Vargo's been defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.66,0:07:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.34,0:07:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Though Baby Five and Buffalo\Nshould be able to recover him soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.42,0:07:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I misjudged the whole situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.52,0:07:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Deep in the third lab,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.30,0:07:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll find the weapon responsible for\Ndestroying the first two laboratories,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.34,0:07:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,as well as the rest of the\Nisland, exactly four years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.64,0:07:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,With the simple push of a button,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.52,0:07:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Punk Hazard's population will\Nbe reduced to a single person.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.66,0:08:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The only one who can survive\Nthe land of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.60,0:08:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Our dear friend Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.24,0:08:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The location of the device...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.16,0:08:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to say another word, Joker.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.80,0:08:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I was going to do it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.78,0:08:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm next to\Nthe switch right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.10,0:08:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The explosion will sink\Ntheir only means of escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.80,0:08:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as long as you're\Nokay with losing a tanker.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.96,0:08:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.92,0:08:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,die for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.42,0:08:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Monda and take everything with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.62,0:08:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,young master.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.36,0:08:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,at the very least.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.64,0:08:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get my revenge on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.78,0:08:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,this is goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.22,0:08:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I, sorry it had to end\Nlike this, old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.90,0:09:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, for your years of service.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.66,0:09:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty hot, huh? This Missile\NGirl's burning passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.14,0:09:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, baby, fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.42,0:09:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You still want to hold on to this weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.58,0:09:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you can already turn\Ninto every weapon you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.44,0:09:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for grabbing it, Buffalo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.70,0:09:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That was sweet. That weapon imbued\Nwith magic powers, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.44,0:10:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever owns this weapon is\Nbound to lead a happy life,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.36,0:10:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and if you buy it from me,\Nyou'll make me a happy man, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.36,0:10:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That was just a scam obviously,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.84,0:10:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,oh crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.12,0:10:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Look up behind you, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.70,0:10:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Iron Pirate! Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.38,0:10:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't fight for peace on the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.32,0:10:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that even for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.50,0:10:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.41,0:10:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Iron Pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.33,0:10:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Done with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.46,0:10:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Weapon-morphosis!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.42,0:10:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Revolver girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.42,0:10:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha! That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.10,0:10:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This ought to do the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.14,0:10:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Deflect this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.84,0:11:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there a dragon here with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.32,0:11:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo, I made him out of\Ngarbage dump. Wow, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.48,0:11:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.04,0:11:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This eel is quite distraught.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.24,0:11:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Please save my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.94,0:11:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.52,0:11:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.28,0:11:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Every one of you, this is where\Nyou will die. Here with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.62,0:11:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,though I won't be around to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.96,0:11:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you'll become\Nthe king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.20,0:12:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.28,0:12:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.08,0:12:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But that sounded pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.30,0:12:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Must have come from building D.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.58,0:12:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.80,0:12:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the S.A.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.44,0:12:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Manufacturing Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.00,0:12:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Monet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.26,0:12:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.90,0:12:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I was under the impression that my\Nheart was in Caesar's possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.56,0:12:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So how the hell did you end\Nup getting your hands on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.04,0:12:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Simply put, he got\Nmixed up on the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.74,0:12:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I hold on to your heart for safekeeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.24,0:13:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He let me hold on to his\Nsecretary Monet's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.56,0:13:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We have ourselves a deal,\Nshall we shake on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.98,0:13:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And as you know, I sliced out your\Nheart when you first arrived at the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.48,0:13:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The heart of the leader of\Nthe T5, Vice Admiral Smoker.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.48,0:13:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What a wonderful souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.32,0:13:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.20,0:13:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He just made that assumption and\NI didn't bother correcting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.66,0:13:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But I gave him back Monet's\Nheart out of kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.52,0:13:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a response.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.44,0:13:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,As the old saying goes, when you do\Nsomething nice for other people...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.88,0:13:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that good karma's\Nbound to come back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.12,0:13:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.40,0:13:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This tunnel's gonna collapse any second!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.12,0:14:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.26,0:14:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The ceiling's completely giving out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.16,0:14:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This tunnel is burrowed\Ndirectly through the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.08,0:14:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The cave Zin will be buried.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.84,0:14:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta do something about it or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.80,0:14:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.80,0:14:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The passage is blocked!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.30,0:14:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit the brakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.32,0:14:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.62,0:14:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He saved us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.98,0:14:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want that guy as\Nmy enemy, even if he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.26,0:14:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's bound to be a gas\Ncloud blocking the exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.76,0:14:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone on board capable of\Nconjuring up some wind? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.18,0:14:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You expect someone to just\Ncoincidentally have that power?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.54,0:14:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.38,0:14:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do that. Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.02,0:15:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see the end of the tunnel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.88,0:15:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.79,0:15:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little more to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.84,0:15:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Move faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.06,0:15:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.16,0:15:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't find the young master.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.82,0:15:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He should be in his room\Non the fourth floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.64,0:15:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.08,0:15:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I looked up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.56,0:15:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The window was open.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.62,0:15:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, well then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.54,0:15:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.04,0:15:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like he headed\Noff on his own again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.16,0:15:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.07,0:15:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what's happening over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.52,0:15:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.43,0:15:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We got some kind of metal security guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.74,0:15:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Giving us trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.94,0:16:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But other than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.52,0:16:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The two of you are still safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.24,0:16:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.18,0:16:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, it's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.56,0:16:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, I want you two to\Ntake care of that guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.30,0:16:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be there shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.24,0:16:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.56,0:16:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I am an Invincible Iron Palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.36,0:16:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Super!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.18,0:17:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,After an attack like that, even\Na pacifista would be busted up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.76,0:17:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Weapon Morphosis!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.70,0:17:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Flying Sis Girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.08,0:17:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Make his head spin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.74,0:17:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Weapon Morphosis!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.78,0:17:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire Girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.10,0:17:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.22,0:17:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.98,0:17:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot, hot, hot, hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.18,0:17:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No enemy, however strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.14,0:17:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,is immune from the burning passion\Nof Firegirl's flame of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.60,0:17:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Fix that, Franky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.86,0:17:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,General AMG!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.14,0:17:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.86,0:17:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Any fresh ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.60,0:17:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He's one tough customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.78,0:17:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.18,0:17:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready for more, fan\Nman and weapon woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.64,0:18:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, baby, you think what I'm thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.44,0:18:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We serve him up something special\Nthat no one's ever been able to block.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.32,0:18:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Try your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.72,0:18:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.58,0:18:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Super!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.49,0:18:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing will work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.46,0:18:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll chop you up down to nuts and bolts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.94,0:18:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold the spinning weapon of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.52,0:18:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sickle girl, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.00,0:18:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll give you props.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.58,0:18:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not every day\Nsomeone's got enough power
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.94,0:18:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,to punch a hole through the general body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.42,0:18:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But I gotta say, what you're trying to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.04,0:18:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,it's like a praying man that's\Nlooking to sink a battleship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.24,0:18:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in for a treat. The thousand\Nsun will come in a whole sea one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.60,0:18:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,but in the.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.51,0:18:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,In the meantime, I want\Nto give you a taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.88,0:18:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,of this ultimate secret weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.68,0:19:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell anybody else\Nthough, cause it's a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.94,0:19:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The land-based portal gallon cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.22,0:19:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The working title is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.98,0:19:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.70,0:19:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Shenron King!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.84,0:19:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Still don't know who this guy is!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.66,0:19:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Or why he's so hell-bent on\Nkeeping up from retrieving Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.10,0:19:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that passed out down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.34,0:19:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.94,0:19:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder how he got all the way out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.06,0:19:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It don't matter who's paying you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.26,0:19:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not gonna get our\Nasses kicked that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.10,0:19:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.10,0:20:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Still standing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.34,0:20:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta admit you're tough, for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.18,0:20:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think we're just your\Ngarden-variety hooligans,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.54,0:20:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,pal, you're gonna get a rude awakening!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.62,0:20:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.72,0:20:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,By the name of Joker!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.00,0:20:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're taking Caesar! You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.54,0:20:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't stop us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.70,0:20:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.61,0:20:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So your plan is finally revealed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.76,0:20:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are trying to escape with Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.28,0:20:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I see a light up ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.04,0:20:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep the wind going, Nami! More!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.02,0:20:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be a world of poison outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.92,0:20:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You've seen what I've seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.48,0:20:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The general's so cool! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.04,0:20:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Super!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.30,0:20:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a super!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.78,0:20:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,With a good toy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.86,0:21:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Buffalo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.77,0:21:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby Five, what are you doing here? Us?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.52,0:21:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And what do you think you're doing\Nhelping the Straw Hats and kids escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.02,0:21:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Lost turned traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.44,0:21:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Joker saved the heart seed for\Nyou, and you go and betray him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.10,0:21:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, are they your friends or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.32,0:21:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.23,0:21:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They're my enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.34,0:21:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All of the Straw Hats in the\NNavy Team Five against us?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.56,0:21:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are losing odds.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.86,0:21:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta split!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.04,0:21:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Baby Five, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.54,0:21:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here? Saving you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.98,0:21:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We're taking you to the young master.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.10,0:21:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They grabbed Caesar and made a run for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.56,0:21:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.18,0:21:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a sniper's job to take him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.64,0:21:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Those bastards...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.56,0:21:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up, Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.54,0:21:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp said he's got a handle\Non the situation, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.28,0:21:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,First class sniper.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.84,0:21:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.32,0:22:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.23,0:22:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What if he misses?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.32,0:22:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If Caesar escapes, this\Nwhole planet's ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.54,0:22:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we in alliance or aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.68,0:22:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're going to work together,\Nhow about showing a little trust?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.38,0:22:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What alliance? Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.82,0:22:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.88,0:22:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.06,0:22:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I went on the offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.34,0:22:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Think you got away?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.10,0:22:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Think again, cowards!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.78,0:22:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.62,0:22:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.72,0:22:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially when they're wounded\Nand their backs are to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.20,0:22:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Too easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.48,0:22:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, any day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.78,0:22:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,First, you need a little water.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.74,0:22:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, work your magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.54,0:22:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to grow!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.86,0:22:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Black Kabuto and... Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.80,0:22:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.92,0:22:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna need it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.78,0:22:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like they're about to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.74,0:23:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, buffalo—leave the\Nflag to me while I'm busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.42,0:23:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep the skies clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.26,0:23:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We got a mission to complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.96,0:23:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What, Roger?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.00,0:23:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That, my—you really\Nneed me. Don't you then?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.98,0:23:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.18,0:23:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll protect you with my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.16,0:23:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, high feather egg!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.82,0:23:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,feather egg
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.80,0:23:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Something just flew overhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.84,0:23:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to hatch!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.10,0:23:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Little bolt!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.60,0:23:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A thunder storm? Buffalo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.10,0:23:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.28,0:23:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying, I'm trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.06,0:23:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.52,0:23:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Meteorology attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.90,0:23:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunderbreed!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.44,0:23:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! Tempo! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.52,0:24:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something, baby! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.92,0:24:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She's out cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.56,0:24:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to wrap this up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.12,0:24:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it, Jumpgrass!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.26,0:24:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Special attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.80,0:24:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Meteor Storm Assault!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.56,0:24:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Buffalo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.47,0:24:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.39,0:24:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Or fly for that matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.78,0:24:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you gotta protect me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.52,0:24:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I always perform my duty!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.68,0:24:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm part of the Dachyote family!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.74,0:24:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The mission above all else!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.84,0:24:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Lights, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.22,0:24:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're good for nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.52,0:24:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, try it! I'm gas!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.86,0:24:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.38,0:24:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta make it to Dressrosa with or without\NBuffalo and Baby Five. Nope. Afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.82,0:24:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That last shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.84,0:24:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No. What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.78,0:25:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A sea prism stone handcuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.00,0:25:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And that is how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.48,0:25:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, in your face, Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.62,0:25:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,When the enemy turns\Ntheir back, I'm there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.18,0:25:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,With the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.42,0:25:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.42,0:25:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
